   "display_name": "Sacrificial Brand",
   "unlock_upgrade": 0,
   "description": "Each hit of an attack from this unit will apply Bleed\n\nEvery hit from a RegularAttack from this unit will:\n- Deal the remaining total damage of all Bleed stacks on the enemy instantly as TrueDamage\n- Remove all Bleed stacks on the enemy"
  },
  {
   "name": "GutsPassive2",
   "display_name": "Crimson Spill",
   "unlock_upgrade": 0,
   "description": "When an enemy that have been inflicted with Bleed at least 1 time dies:\n- Leave 1 GutsSpill on the ground for 6 seconds\n\nGutsSpill will apply 1 stack of Bleed every 5 seconds.\nOnly 2 non-permanent GutsSpill may exist at a time."
  },
  {
   "name": "GutsPassive3",
   "display_name": "Feeding Ground",
   "unlock_upgrade": 0,
   "description": "If 2 GutsSpill overlap, they will combine into 1 GutsSpill.\n\nEach time GutsSpill combines:\n- Add 4 seconds to its despawn timer\n- Increase its radius by 15%\n\nWhen a GutsSpill combines 10 times:\n- The GutsSpill becomes permanent\n\nPermanent GutsSpill's cannot combine.\nOnly 2 permanent GutsSpill may exist at a time."
  }
